<title>USA: CompUSA Q1 same-store sales up 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>CompUSA Q1 same-store sales up 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	   $991	 $782     +26.7	 +7.2</p>
